Neurodegeneration Fluorescent Fundus - License and Usage Notice
===================================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains MATLAB source code and a Jupyter notebook for
the detection and classification of neurodegeneration-associated
protein aggregation via fundus fluorescence imaging, developed by
Alexandre Matov, together with supporting result files and reports. The
code depends on MATLAB toolboxes and Python packages that are NOT
included in this repository -- see DEPENDENCIES.md.

